# The Rescue Drill (San d'Oria 2-1), every status. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria, rank 2 with 1-1, 1-2 and 1-3
# completed, 2-1 current, the Option var 2 and a Bronze Sword. At each status 0 to 11 (a GM sets it before each
# trigger, since a finish moves it) the eight La Theine Plateau NPCs are triggered: each plays its event or answers its
# text as the Lua's arms say, Augevinne and Yaucevouchat with no finish handler, and Equesobillot at status 8 plays
# 112. In Ordelles Caves Ruillont is triggered at each status (his default text 7372, RUILLONT_INITIAL_DIALOG + 2, at
# statuses 0 and 1; 1 at 2 to 7; RUILLONT_INITIAL_DIALOG at 8 and 9, +9 from 10; at 9 and 11 the 7372 default plays
# before the mission text), and the sword is traded at statuses 0, 8, 10 and 11: those trades send nothing (the status-9
# trade is not in this flow).
lists LaTheinePlateau/Augevinne/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Deaufrain/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Equesobillot/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Galaihaurat/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Laurisse/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Narvecaint/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Vicorpasse/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/Yaucevouchat/onTrigger LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/101 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/102 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/106 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/107 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/108 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/110 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/112 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/113 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/114 LaTheinePlateau/onEventFinish/115 OrdellesCaves/Ruillont/onTrigger OrdellesCaves/Ruillont/onTrade OrdellesCaves/onEventFinish/1
char zone=LaTheinePlateau pos=-344,37,266 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
rank 2
item BronzeSword
mission Sandoria TheRescueDrill current
charvar Mission[0][3]Option 2
login
